`harvey-trio-contract`: Harvey side has exactly 3 Harvey reviewers/agents producing independent findings or votes; Admin remains only as merge/consensus agent; no admin reviewers/final reviewers exist in production flow (used by: app/backend/agents/reviewer.py, app/backend/agents/admin.py, app/backend/orchestration/state_machine.py, app/backend/services/run_service.py, app/frontend/src/components/VerdictCard.tsx, docs/EVALUATION_PLAN.md)

`harvey-rag-only`: only Harvey can query tenant PDF/vector RAG; Kira cannot query document-vector RAG and may only use uploaded contract text plus existing structured corpus logic unless explicitly removed later (used by: app/backend/services/rag_retrieval.py, app/backend/orchestration/state_machine.py, app/backend/agents/reviewer.py, docs/RAG_DESIGN.md)

`evidence-schema`: split evidence into `contract_evidence` and `rag_citations`; Harvey contradiction findings require validated `rag_citations`, Kira findings require `contract_evidence`; validators check cited IDs against retrieval traces (used by: app/backend/models/schemas.py, app/backend/db/models.py, app/backend/agents/validator.py, app/frontend/src/types/index.ts, app/frontend/src/components/VerdictCard.tsx)

`auth-derived-tenancy`: tenant/workspace identity must come from authenticated membership, never caller-provided form fields; RAG ingestion is admin/workspace-admin only (used by: app/backend/routes/rag.py, app/backend/services/auth_service.py, app/backend/routes/contracts.py)

`rag-storage-contract`: Postgres + pgvector storage for source documents, document versions, chunks, embeddings, ingestion jobs, and retrieval traces; metadata includes `tenant_id`, `doc_type`, `policy_family_id`, `version`, `jurisdiction`, `source_path`, `page`, `chunk_hash` (used by: app/backend/db/models.py, app/backend/alembic/versions/0003_add_harvey_rag.py, app/backend/services/rag_ingestion.py, app/backend/services/rag_retrieval.py)

`parser-confidence-contract`: Docling primary parser, OCR fallback, pdfplumber last fallback; confidence propagates to pages, clauses, and evidence anchors with visible warning/blocked/override states, not a blind global cutoff (used by: app/backend/services/parser.py, app/backend/orchestration/state_machine.py, app/frontend/src/components/PipelineTracker.tsx, tests/test_parser_confidence.py)

`model-registry-contract`: model registry supports 1 fine-tuned Gemma 26B endpoint and 3 non-fine-tuned baseline endpoints; disabled/missing endpoints are reported as `N/A - weights pending` instead of crashing (used by: configs/models.yaml, scripts/eval_model_registry.py, scripts/eval_finetune_vs_baseline.py, docs/EVALUATION_PLAN.md)

`observability-contract`: metrics include run count by status, stage duration histogram, provider latency/failures, JSON repair count, retrieval hit count, citation validation failures, queue age, retry count, and worker lease expiry (used by: app/backend/main.py, app/backend/worker.py, app/backend/services/metrics.py, docs/RUNBOOK.md)

